From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:45:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] translations: Russian stock Flashforge names, Kiln screens in Russian (issue #23)

Russian uses the stock Flashforge names where they share a term (Смещение
по Z, Wi-Fi, Компенсация вибраций), fixes four values patch 0030 left
with doubled text and a slot counter that showed {0}, and adds the
strings of the Kiln screens (plugins, sounds, nozzle size, bed soak, IFS
activity, auto-refill, the AD5X setup wizard) to en.yml and ru.yml.
Other languages show those in English.
---
 translations/en.yml | 207 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 translations/ru.yml | 382 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 495 insertions(+), 94 deletions(-)

